  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 14: dX-dX OPE with self-contraction\n\ndX fields self-contract via MWick, giving:\n$$\\partial X^\\mu(z)\\,\\partial X^\\nu(w) \\sim R[\\partial X^\\mu(z), \\partial X^\\nu(w)] - \frac{\\alpha'\\,\delta^{\\mu\\nu}}{2(z-w)^2}$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test14 = OPE[R[dX[\\[Mu], 0, z]], R[dX[\\[Nu], 0, w]]];\nexpected14 = R[dX[\\[Mu], 0, z], dX[\\[Nu], 0, w]] - \\[Alpha]p \\[Delta][\\[Mu], \\[Nu]]/(2 (z - w)^2);\ntest14Result = Simplify[test14 - expected14] === 0;\nPrint[\"Test 14 (dX-dX OPE): \", If[test14Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest14Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
