  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Composite Operator Tests (expX)\n\nTests for OPE of dX / dXt with the plane wave vertex operator expX[k, w, wbar] = e^{ik.X(w,wbar)}.\n\nThe SWick contraction gives:\n$$\text{SWick}[dX^\\mu(z),\\, e^{ik\\cdot X(w)}] = -\frac{\\alpha'}{2}\\,i\\,k^\\mu\\,\frac{1}{z-w}$$",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 19: SWick of dX[mu,0,z] with expX\n\nBasic single-pole contraction. Result should contain k[mu] and 1/(z-w).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test19 = SWick[dX[\\[Mu], 0, z], expX[k, w, wbar]];\nPrint[\"Test 19 (SWick dX-expX): \", test19 // InputForm];\ntest19Result = Not[FreeQ[test19, k[\\[Mu]]]] && (Not[FreeQ[test19, 1/(z - w)]] || Not[FreeQ[test19, 1/(w - z)]]);\nPrint[\"Test 19 (has k[mu] and single pole): \", If[test19Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest19Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Test 19 (SWick dX-expX): ((-1/2*I)*Î±p*k[Î¼])/(-w + z)\n</pre>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "\"Test 19 (SWick dX-expX): ((-1/2*I)*Î±p*k[Î¼])/(-w + z)\\n\"",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
