  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Test 22: Full OPE of R[dX] with R[expX]\n\nThe OPE combines the singular SWick contraction (times expX) with the regular normal-ordered term R[dX, expX].",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test22 = OPE[R[dX[\\[Mu], 0, z]], R[expX[k, w, wbar]]];\nPrint[\"Test 22 (OPE dX-expX): \", test22 // InputForm];\n(* Singular part is SWick * expX; regular part is R[dX, expX]. Check both expX symbols present. *)\ntest22Result = Not[FreeQ[test22, expX]] && Not[FreeQ[test22, k[\\[Mu]]]];\nPrint[\"Test 22 (has expX and k[mu]): \", If[test22Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest22Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
